<div class="ops reveal">
  <div class="ops-copy">
    <div class="eyebrow">Built by operators</div>
    <h2>The playbook on this site is the playbook we have run ourselves.</h2>
    <p>The people behind Anvil have launched and run insurance-billing care companies: virtual, hybrid, in-home, and in-person, across commercial, Medicaid, and Medicare Advantage. We built the platform we kept wishing existed.</p>
    <a href="/company" class="btn btn-ghost">Meet the team</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="ops-facts">
    <li><strong>Formed the PC</strong><span>and placed the physician owner, state by state</span></li>
    <li><strong>Chased the roster-add</strong><span>and built the tracker that ended it</span></li>
    <li><strong>Worked the MCO panel</strong><span>including the closed ones</span></li>
    <li><strong>Sat in the audit</strong><span>and wrote the charting standard that passed</span></li>
  </ul>
</div>
<style>
  .ops { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; }
  .ops-copy p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; }
  .ops-facts { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .ops-facts li { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px 16px; display: grid; gap: 2px; }
  .ops-facts strong { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink); }
  .ops-facts span { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .ops { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
